#: ../../source/2-how_to/3-programming/5-python_interface.md:80
#: 77abd42b86d745dfb2124a47141f5a0b
msgid "FSM commands"
msgstr "FSM 命令"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/3-programming/5-python_interface.md:82
#: dc4961ba080e4bba8af15594b2b3a4a1
msgid ""
"`/fsm_command` is **`std_msgs/Int32`** (not strings such as `stand` / "
"`walk`). Send integers with `send_fsm_command` (`1` HOME, `2` HOLD, `3` "
"OCS2, `4` MOVEJ, `5` COMPLIANCE). Values and legal transitions depend on "
"the running controller. See [FSM and "
"Topics](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md)."
msgstr ""
"`/fsm_command` 是 **`std_msgs/Int32`**（不是 `stand` / `walk` 这类字符串）。用 `send_fsm_command` 发送整数（`1` HOME、`2` HOLD、`3` OCS2、`4` MOVEJ、`5` COMPLIANCE）。取值与合法转换取决于正在运行的控制器。见 [状态机与话题](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/3-programming/5-python_interface.md:84
#: f4f3dbdabd444a4b8380586e1a2ff127
msgid ""
"WBC body / arm / base strings go to `/mode_command` via "
"`send_mode_command`, which is a different topic from `/fsm_command`."
msgstr ""
"WBC 的身体 / 手臂 / 底盘字符串经 `send_mode_command` 发到 `/mode_command`，与 `/fsm_command` 不是同一条话题。"

